{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0058","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000039:text","row":14810,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「それより、部活しませんか？」","en":"“Why don’t we do some club work instead?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00001","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00001"],"en":"Taichi: \"More importantly, shall we have activities?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00009","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000039:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000000f5:text","row":14811,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「……まあ」","en":"“...Well.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00010","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00002","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00002"],"en":"Misato: \"...well.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00010","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000000f5:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000119:text","row":14812,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩がじっと見つめてくる。","en":"Miyasumi stared at me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02024","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00003","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00003"],"en":"Senpai gazes at me fixedly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02024","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000119:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000001d1:text","row":14813,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「手伝いにきてくれたんですか？」","en":"“Did you come to help?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00368","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00004","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00004"],"en":"Misato: \"Did you come to help me?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00368","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000001d1:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000211:text","row":14814,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Yeah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00785","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00005","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00005"],"en":"Taichi: \"Sir!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00785","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000211:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The source is a subdued acknowledgement or noncommittal response. The English changes it into a crisp form of address, altering the speech act and tone.","remedy":"Use a subdued acknowledgement such as 'Yeah' or 'Uh-huh.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":13,"start":9,"text":"Sir!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000256:text","row":14815,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「そうですか」","en":"“I see.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00026","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00006","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00006"],"en":"Misato: \"So you did.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00026","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000256:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000027c:text","row":14816,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"凝然(ぎょうぜん)と、固定された目線が外れない。","en":"Her eyes stayed fixed on mine. Unblinking.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00867","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00007","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00007"],"en":"Her stationary, congealed sight does not move from me.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00867","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000027c:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000323:text","row":14817,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"やがて先輩の顔がふっとほころぶ。","en":"At last, Miyasumi’s face softened into a smile.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02326","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00008","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00008"],"en":"Eventually, Senpai's face puffs into the broadest of smiles.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","mistranslation","word_choice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02326","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000323:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"Her face gently relaxes or opens into a smile. 'Puffs' gives the wrong physical motion, while 'the broadest' adds an unsupported superlative.","remedy":"Describe her face softly relaxing into a smile without the superlative.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":59,"start":26,"text":"puffs into the broadest of smiles"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000380:text","row":14818,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとうございます、ぺけくん」","en":"“Thank you, X.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00394","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00009","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00009"],"en":"Misato: \"Thank you very much, Peke-kun.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00394","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000380:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000003c2:text","row":14819,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえ、帝国軍人として当然であります」","en":"“Only my duty as a soldier of the Empire, ma’am.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00619","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00010","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00010"],"en":"Taichi: \"'Tis nothing, ma'am, it is the ordinary for a soldier of the Empire.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00619","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000003c2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"He mock-formally says that helping is only natural for an imperial soldier. The English uses the adjective 'ordinary' as a noun and produces an ungrammatical military-register line.","remedy":"Use 'only natural for a soldier of the Empire' or an equivalent mock-formal expression.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":76,"start":30,"text":"it is the ordinary for a soldier of the Empire"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000400:text","row":14820,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"敬礼。","en":"I saluted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00089","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00011","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00011"],"en":"Salute!","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00089","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000400:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000041e:text","row":14821,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女はくすくすと笑う。","en":"She giggled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00377","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00012","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00012"],"en":"She laughs with a giggle.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00377","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000041e:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000004d2:text","row":14822,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも残念ですが、今日はもう夜になってしまうのでした」","en":"“But sadly, night is already falling.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00729","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00013","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00013"],"en":"Misato: \"It is too bad, but the day has already turned to night.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","tense_aspect"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00729","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000004d2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"She says that the day is about to give way to night, explaining why the activity must end. The English states that night has already arrived, changing the temporal relation.","remedy":"Say that it is already going to be night or is getting late.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":63,"start":28,"text":"the day has already turned to night"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000545:text","row":14823,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「楽しい部活の時間は、おしまい」","en":"“Fun club time is over.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02189","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00014","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00014"],"en":"Misato: \"The time for fun club activity is all done.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02189","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000545:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000585:text","row":14824,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「えー」","en":"“Aww.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00174","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00015","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00015"],"en":"Taichi: \"Eeeh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00174","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000585:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000005ca:text","row":14825,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「すいませんね、一人でやるって決めていたので、時間は流動的だったりするんです」","en":"“Sorry. I’d planned on doing this alone, so my schedule is rather fluid.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02177","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00016","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00016"],"en":"Misato: \"Sorry, because I decided to do this on my own, the hours are fluid.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02177","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000005ca:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000638:text","row":14826,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「でも一人じゃ終わらないですよ？　配線だってあるでしょうし」","en":"“But you’ll never finish alone. You’ll need to run wiring, and—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01208","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00017","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00017"],"en":"Taichi: \"But alone you cannot finish this, right? There is the wiring.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01208","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000638:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000694:text","row":14827,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「そもそも電源だって」","en":"“You don’t even have a power source—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01000","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00018","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00018"],"en":"Taichi: \"For starters, there is the electricity.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01000","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000694:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000748:text","row":14828,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「平気ですよ」","en":"“I’ll manage.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01920","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00019","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00019"],"en":"Misato: \"It is alright!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01920","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000748:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000007f4:text","row":14829,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「女は度胸です」","en":"“A woman’s got to have guts.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00448","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00020","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00020"],"en":"Misato: \"Women are pluck.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00448","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000007f4:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"Pluck correctly means courage. The only confirmed defect is the malformed slogan-like predicate Women are pluck.","remedy":"Use an idiomatic courage maxim.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":9,"text":"Women are pluck"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000824:text","row":14830,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ男は愛ですね」","en":"“Then a man’s got to have love.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01152","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00021","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00021"],"en":"Taichi: \"Then men pluck them out.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01152","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000824:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000858:text","row":14831,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、ぼかぁ、ぼかぁ―――」","en":"“Miyasumi, I—I—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00737","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00022","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00022"],"en":"Taichi: \"Senpai, pwease, pwease---\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","mistranslation","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00737","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000858:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"ぼかぁ is a slurred or drawn-out contraction of 僕は, not securely a childish deformation. Pwease still replaces the failed self-reference with an unsupported plea.","remedy":"Preserve the broken I—I— performance.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":17,"text":"pwease, pwease"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000088e:text","row":14832,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"にじり寄ろうとすると、","en":"As I began to edge closer—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00686","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00023","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00023"],"en":"I go to sidle up and,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00686","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000088e:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000942:text","row":14833,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「部活しゅーりょーっ！」","en":"“Club’s o-ver!”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01098","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00024","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00024"],"en":"Misato: \"Cluuub haaas concludeeed!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01098","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000942:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000a21:text","row":14834,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐぶぅっ」","en":"“Gubuh!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01343","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00025","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00025"],"en":"Taichi: \"G'buh!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01343","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000a21:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000a45:text","row":14835,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"顔面を片手で突き押され、よりさらに不細工になる俺。","en":"She planted one hand on my face and shoved, making me uglier still.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01183","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00026","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00026"],"en":"With one hand she squeezes on my face, turning me ever more ugly.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01183","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000a45:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"She pushes or shoves his face away with one hand. The English changes the forceful pushing action into squeezing his face.","remedy":"Describe her pushing his face away with one hand.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":37,"start":18,"text":"squeezes on my face"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000a8f:text","row":14836,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"『ぐぶぅ』とか言っちゃってもうマリアナ海溝の底まで落ちたって感じ。","en":"That single “gubuh” sent me plummeting to the bottom of the Mariana Trench.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01284","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00027","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00027"],"en":"And blurting stuff like that \"g'buh\" felt like having fallen to the bottom of the Marianas Trench.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01284","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000a8f:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000b6f:text","row":14837,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「さ、帰りましょう。と言いましても、あなたとわたしは帰る方向も正反対ですけれど、ほほほほ」","en":"“Now, let’s go home. Of course, you and I are headed in opposite directions. Ho ho ho ho.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00978","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00028","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00028"],"en":"Misato: \"So! Let's go home. And I remind you, that my way home and yours are in the exact opposite direction, hohohohoh!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00978","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000b6f:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000be9:text","row":14838,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「……なーんか、釈然としません」","en":"“...This still doesn’t seem fair.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02351","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00029","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00029"],"en":"Taichi: \"...whaaat, this cannot be fully satisfying!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02351","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000be9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000ca7:text","row":14839,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、今日はとても楽しかったでしょう？」","en":"“But you certainly had fun today, didn’t you?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00388","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00030","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00030"],"en":"Misato: \"But still, today was really fun, was it not?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00388","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000ca7:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000cf3:text","row":14840,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「んー、どうでしょうねー」","en":"“Hmm. I wonder.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01875","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00031","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00031"],"en":"Taichi: \"Hmmm, was it now...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01875","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000cf3:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000d4a:text","row":14841,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「わたしの胸に顔をうずめてる時、お尻触ってましたよね？」","en":"“While you had your face buried in my chest, you were groping my butt, weren’t you?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02043","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00032","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00032"],"en":"Misato: \"When you were with your face buried in my chest, you were touching my butt, right?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02043","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000d4a:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000da2:text","row":14842,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00513","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00033","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00033"],"en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00513","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000da2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000e48:text","row":14843,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぐにぐにーって、すごい触り方で」","en":"“Really kneading away at it, too.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01607","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00034","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00034"],"en":"Misato: \"With plenty of squeeze, and you going all 'squishity-squish!'\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01607","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000e48:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000ea7:text","row":14844,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかも両手で」","en":"“With both hands, no less.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01911","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00035","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00035"],"en":"Misato: \"And furthermore, with both hands.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01911","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000ea7:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000ed7:text","row":14845,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“........”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00927","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00036","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00036"],"en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00927","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000ed7:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000f81:text","row":14846,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"「くすぐったかったです」","en":"“It tickled.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01734","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00037","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00037"],"en":"Misato: \"And it tickled.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01734","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000f81:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000fb9:text","row":14847,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「～♪」","en":"“♪”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02080","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00038","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00038"],"en":"Taichi: \"～♪\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02080","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000fb9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00000fd9:text","row":14848,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"あさっての方角に向けて、口笛を吹く。","en":"I looked off toward next Tuesday and whistled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00376","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00039","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00039"],"en":"So I whistled when faced with this derailing of thoughts.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["idiom_calque","mistranslation","undertranslation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00376","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00000fd9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"He physically turns toward a completely unrelated direction and whistles, using the idiom 'toward the day after tomorrow.' The English removes the physical direction and replaces it with an abstract derailment of thought.","remedy":"Describe him whistling while looking off in a random or unrelated direction.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":56,"start":14,"text":"when faced with this derailing of thoughts"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000109b:text","row":14849,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「オ・ト・コ・ノ・コ、なんですものねー」","en":"“Boys. Will. Be. Boys.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01472","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00040","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00040"],"en":"Misato: \"Be-ca-use-you-are-a-boooy, are you!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01472","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000109b:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"She pointedly concludes that this is because he is a boy. The English appends an inverted interrogative tag to the already stated cause, producing the wrong syntax and rhetorical force.","remedy":"Use an emphatic assertion such as 'Because you're a boy, after all.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":36,"text":"are you!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000010db:text","row":14850,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"こめかみのあたりを、ぐりぐりとつつかれる。","en":"She dug a finger into my temple and ground it around.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01027","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00041","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00041"],"en":"She drills back and forth right on my temples.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01027","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000010db:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000111d:text","row":14851,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"けっこう痛い。","en":"It hurt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00221","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00042","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00042"],"en":"It's fairly painful.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00221","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000111d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001143:text","row":14852,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"ごまかせるはずもなかったのだ。","en":"There was no playing that off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01166","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00043","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00043"],"en":"I could never swindle my way out of this.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01166","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001143:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001181:text","row":14853,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「うう……すいません……」","en":"“Ugh... I’m sorry...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02169","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00044","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00044"],"en":"Taichi: \"Ngggh... sorryyy...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02169","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001181:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001239:text","row":14854,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「さて、どうしたものやら」","en":"“Now, what am I to do with you?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01565","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00045","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00045"],"en":"Misato: \"Well then, what am I to do with this.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01565","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001239:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001290:text","row":14855,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「わたしも、そのくらいの価値はある女だったってことですかね」","en":"“So I’m a woman worth at least that much to you?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00804","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00046","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00046"],"en":"Misato: \"Would that mean I, myself, am a woman with about that kind of value?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["register_voice","tense_aspect"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00804","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001290:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"She wonders whether the past incident means she was a woman worth that much to him. The English shifts the marked past-tense reflection into a present-tense statement about her general identity.","remedy":"Preserve the retrospective 'was a woman worth that much' framing.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":76,"start":36,"text":"am a woman with about that kind of value"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001309:text","row":14856,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「それともぺけくんが無節操なだけですかねー？」","en":"“Or will you monkey around with anything in a skirt, X?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02082","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00047","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00047"],"en":"Misato: \"Or is it that you are merely unprincipled, Peke-kun?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02082","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001309:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001357:text","row":14857,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやいやいや、虚無僧ではありますが無節操などには！」","en":"“No, no, no! I may be a monk, but I’m no monkey!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00009","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00048","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00048"],"en":"Taichi: \"NoNnoNno, I may be a Komusou, but unprincipled, really!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","logical_relation","undertranslation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00009","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001357:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"He protests that although he may be a komusou, he is not indiscriminate. The ellipsis-dependent Japanese denial is not completed in English, leaving an ungrammatical phrase that can read as an admission of the accusation.","remedy":"Complete the denial: 'I may be a komusou, but I'm not indiscriminate.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":63,"start":39,"text":"but unprincipled, really"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000013ad:text","row":14858,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「奴らと同列にされては困ります！！」","en":"“Don’t lump me in with those beasts!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02263","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00049","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00049"],"en":"Taichi: \"Putting me side by side with that sort worries me!!!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02263","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000013ad:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000013e9:text","row":14859,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"必死に誤魔化す俺の、緊急ギャグは果てしなく寒い。","en":"My desperate emergency joke was cold enough to hit absolute zero.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01483","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00050","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00050"],"en":"When I'm desperate to deceive, my Emergency Jokes are endlessly lame.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01483","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000013e9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000014b7:text","row":14860,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふふふ」","en":"“Hee hee.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00053","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00051","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00051"],"en":"Misato: \"Heh heh heh!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00053","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000014b7:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000014d9:text","row":14861,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"夕刻の、さらに濃度を増したオレンジを背景に、先輩は体をすこし傾けて、言った。","en":"Against the deepening orange of evening, Miyasumi leaned slightly to one side and said:","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01926","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00052","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00052"],"en":"In this evening hour, in this scene where the density of orange grows ever more, Senpai leaned her body just a little and spoke.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01926","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000014d9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000015c3:text","row":14862,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「許してあげますから、帰って反省タイムです」","en":"“I’ll forgive you. Now go home and think about what you’ve done.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00511","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00053","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00053"],"en":"Misato: \"I will forgive you for now, so it is time to go home and reflect.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00511","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000015c3:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000168d:text","row":14863,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「さようなら、ですよ。ぺけくん」","en":"“It’s goodbye now, X.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01922","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00054","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00054"],"en":"Misato: \"This is goodbye, then, Peke-kun.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01922","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000168d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000017a2:text","row":14864,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"校舎を出て、屋上を見上げた。","en":"I left the school building and looked up at the roof.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01529","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00055","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00055"],"en":"I left the school building, and looked up at the rooftop.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01529","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000017a2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000017d6:text","row":14865,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナが立っていた。","en":"The antenna stood there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01624","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00056","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00056"],"en":"There the antenna stood.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01624","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000017d6:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001804:text","row":14866,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"その隣。","en":"Beside it—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02380","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00057","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00057"],"en":"And next to it,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02380","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001804:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001824:text","row":14867,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩はまだ、そこにいる。","en":"Miyasumi was still up there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01049","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00058","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00058"],"en":"Senpai was, once more, still there,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01049","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001824:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:00001854:text","row":14868,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"作業していた。","en":"Working.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00103","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00059","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00059"],"en":"working, blue collar,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00103","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:00001854:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The source simply says that she was working. The English adds a blue-collar social or occupational characterization that is absent and does not fit the linked sentence.","remedy":"Use only 'working' or 'still working.'","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":9,"text":"blue collar"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:0000187a:text","row":14869,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"もうじき夜になるのに。","en":"Though night would soon fall.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02140","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00060","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00060"],"en":"even when it will soon be night,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02140","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:0000187a:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000018a8:text","row":14870,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"一人で。","en":"Alone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02243","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00061","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00061"],"en":"alone.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02243","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000018a8:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000018c8:text","row":14871,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"この時になってはじめて。","en":"Only then did I understand—","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00011","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00062","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00062"],"en":"And it was at this moment that, for the first time,","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00011","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000018c8:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0058:000018f8:text","row":14872,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"やんわりと、手伝いを拒絶されたのだと気づいた。","en":"that she had gently refused my help.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00012","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0011a:00063","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0011a:00063"],"en":"I realized that help had been refused, with gentleness.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00012","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0058:000018f8:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]}]}
